{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"hank_and_jessica.jpg","id":"851700409797705816","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850834877057204225/851700409797705816-hank_and_jessica.jpg","message_id":"851700412629516348","sha256":"e01351e8acf7a29759ee441416eb1933f467ba771bccc56313abf158850160f5","size":813481,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850834877057204225/851700409797705816/hank_and_jessica.jpg?ex=6ac09851&is=6abf46d1&hm=4f4ad768ade2a054b899d9fe67a0897ecfc5ab269029f5e69993813b463ab5aa&"}],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850834877057204225","content":"Hank the pigeon lord, and his partner Relm are the proprietors of this business.","created_at":"2021-06-08T05:53:22.199000Z","edited_at":"2021-06-09T05:36:53.010000Z","id":"851700412629516348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850834877057204225","content":"For sale: **Noirite**   To augment weapons with Noirite, add and aditional 500 to your items. It may not be used to augment used items, unless you bring your own materials.\n\nWhile this material is malleable during crafting and as sharp as any steel blade, under certain circumstances it is more brittle than other materials. Due to its glass like nature it is harder for foes to see coming and defend against, you gain +2 to hit with Noirite blades. Unfortunately once tempered it becomes much more brittle, if you roll a natural 1 on an attack roll the blade shatters.","created_at":"2021-06-09T05:38:04.820000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T08:49:19.642000Z","id":"852058952728051713","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850834877057204225","content":"Svirfneblin Mystic’s Gloves\nUncommon 2,000 gp\nRed dyed leather gloves emblazoned with Deep Gnome spell script. While wearing these gloves you have a +5 to Sleight of Hand checks to pickpocket a target. You also can cast Minor Illusion (Spell Save DC = 8 + INT Mod + Proficiency Bonus) at will.\nMcGinty’s Marvelous Elixer Demixer\n\nFor Sale:  **Shale Whip**, Whip\nUncommon: 1,000 gp\nThe end of this finely crafted leather whip has several sharpened stones attached to it. You gain +1 to all attack and damage rolls with this weapon. You may use this whip to restrain a target. When you restrain them in this way you may deal an extra 1d4 piercing damage as the stones dig into them. Whenever they attempt to break the restraint they take another 1d4 piercing regardless if they are successful or not. As a bonus action you may pull on the whip to deal 1d4 piercing damage.","created_at":"2021-06-09T05:39:07.112000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T08:59:46.189000Z","id":"852059213998850048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850834877057204225","content":"**Lectric Lasso**\nWhip, uncommon\n1,700\nThis long flat cord of leather has a crackling arcane script along either side it’s length. You have +1 on attack rolls and damage. You can choose if the whip deals slashing or lightning damage. When you become attuned to this weapon you learn the Lightning Lure cantrip (Intelligence is your casting modifier). When you cast Lightning Lure using this weapon the range you can reach and the distance pulled are both doubled.\nCoach Gun of Ash\n\n**War “Lock” Pick**\nMelee weapon (war pick), common \n900 gp\nThe point on this War Pick has been smithed in a way that it can imitate a lock pick. This weapon doubles as thieves’ tools. When you make a check to unlock a door you may add your Strength modifier to the roll.\n**Wizard’s Beard and Hat**\nRare, wondrous item (requires attunement by a spellcaster)\n8,000 gp\nA fake wizard’s beard is attached to a pointy blue hat with silvery stars. When you attune to this item the beard attaches to your face and remains there until you unattune to the Beard and Hat. Once attuned you can change the appearance of the beard and hat, so long as you still appear to have a beard and hat on. You also gain +1 bonus to your Spell Attack, Spell Save, and AC while attuned to the Wizard’s Beard and Hat.","created_at":"2021-07-10T08:21:24.604000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T09:00:17.389000Z","id":"863334079835406368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850834877057204225","content":"Wilhelm’s Folly\nRare, quarterstaff (requires attunement)\nRequires at least 16 Charisma\n4000 gp\n\n\nA staff designed for a mad comic who wished to “...really blow the audience away.” Atop the head of the staff is an enchanted metal cage that amplifies it’s users voice three fold. This staff has 7 charges. While attuned to it you may use the charges in the following ways.\n    -Spend 3 charges to cast a 3rd level Pulse Wave spell (push only, save DC 15)\n    -Spend 2 charges for the staff to act as a 3rd level Spiritual Weapon spell. When being used in this way you can’t use the staff for anything else until the spell ends.\n    -Spend 3 charges to cast Hideous Laughter spell (save DC 15) on up to 3 targets within 30ft of each other.\n\nThis staff regains 1d6+1 charges daily at dawn.\n\nBanshee’s Wail\nFirearm (Musket)\n7,000 gp\nAgain the general approached the artificer, demanding a rifle that could strike fear into an enemy whilst they stayed safely in the shadows. Enlisting the help of a Gnermish Gnecromancer, the artificer crafted a most frightening firearm. With a long black finished barrel and silver banding adorned each adorned with protective runes, the Banshee’s Wail was a sight to behold and a terror to hear. \n\nThis musket has an increased short and long range of 300/900, respectively. When you fire the gun an anguished wailing fills the air, each creature in a 15-foot-radius centered on the target creature must make a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or drop whatever they are holding and become frightened for 1 minute. If a creature succeeds on the saving throw they are immune to the effect for 24 hours.\n\nIf you hit a target affected by the frightened condition with Banshee's Wail, you deal an additional 1d12 Necrotic damage.","created_at":"2021-07-10T09:02:21.755000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863344385873281024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
